sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Producer
    participant R as Redis
    participant W1 as Worker 1
    participant W2 as Worker 2
    participant S as Status
    P->>R: LPUSH task 1, task 2, task 3
    W1->>R: BRPOP pending
    R-->>W1: task 1
    W2->>R: BRPOP pending
    R-->>W2: task 2
    W1->>W1: Compute square
    W2->>W2: Compute square
    W1->>R: HSET result 1
    W2->>R: HSET result 2
    S->>R: HVALS results
    R-->>S: Completed tasks and worker IDs
